@startuml

hide footbox
autonumber
title To get the list of items on auction \nof a given genre sorted ascending by auction deadline

actor Buyer
participant ":System" as System

Buyer -> System : I want to get the list of items on auction \nof a given genre sorted ascending \nby auction deadline
activate System
Buyer <-- System : Which genre? Choose!
deactivate System
Buyer -> System : genre
activate System
System --> Buyer : Shows the list of items \nsorted by Auction End Date
deactivate System

@enduml